## Current Technical Stack

- Rust: Core blockchain node, consensus, matching engine (HIGH)
- Solidity / Vyper: HyperEVM smart contracts (HIGH)
- TypeScript / JavaScript: Client SDK, frontend, indexing (MEDIUM)
